{"seq":30,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a0104"},"reason":"The paragraph on the fall of Troy now tells how Aeneas carried his father Anchises out of the burning city (with Bernini's sculpture of the scene and Virgil's Aeneid), and the table gains his row, so the new Aeneas question has its sentence.","by":"fact-count-rework","changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",1192],["-","Odysseus"],["+","As"],["=",1],["-","then"],["+","the"],["=",1],["+","city burned, a single Trojan prince escaped with his family: Aeneas, son of the goddess Aphrodite and the mortal Anchises, carried his lame old father on his shoulders out of the flames and led his small son Ascanius by the hand — the scene Gian Lorenzo Bernini carved in marble around 1618–1619. In Virgil's *Aeneid* he sails west to Italy and becomes the ancestor of the Romans. Odysseus, for his part, "],["=",145],["+","\n| Aeneas | Trojan | escapes from burning Troy, ancestor of the Romans |"]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",1164],["+","Als die Stadt brannte, entkam ein einziger trojanischer Prinz mit seiner Familie: Aeneas, Sohn der Göttin Aphrodite und des sterblichen Anchises, trug seinen lahmen alten Vater auf den Schultern aus den Flammen und führte seinen kleinen Sohn Ascanius an der Hand — die Szene, die Gian Lorenzo Bernini um 1618–1619 in Marmor meißelte. In Vergils *Aeneis* segelt er nach Westen bis Italien und wird zum Stammvater der Römer. "],["=",2],["+","seinerseits "],["=",2],["-","danach "],["=",141],["+","\n| Aeneas | trojanisch | entkommt dem brennenden Troja, Stammvater der Römer |"]]},{"field":"bodyRu","diff":[["=",988],["-","Потом"],["+","Когда"],["=",1],["+","город пылал, с семьёй спасся лишь один троянский царевич — Эней, сын богини Афродиты и смертного Анхиза: он вынес на плечах из огня своего хромого старого отца и вёл за руку маленького сына Аскания — эту сцену Джан Лоренцо Бернини высек в мраморе около 1618–1619 годов. В «Энеиде» Вергилия он плывёт на запад, в Италию, и становится прародителем римлян. "],["=",2],["+","же "],["=",129],["+","\n| Эней | троянцы | спасается из горящей Трои, прародитель римлян |"]]}],"hash":"037748f5fe40"},
{"seq":31,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"created","target":{"type":"fact","id":"f28500"},"reason":"New question on the one Trojan prince who escaped the fall of Troy, the most important Trojan figure the article did not yet ask about; verified on Wikipedia's Aeneas article (carrying Anchises from the flames, ancestor of the Romans in the Aeneid) and its article on Bernini's sculpture (c. 1618–19).","by":"fact-count-rework","sources":[{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aeneas"},{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aeneas,_Anchises,_and_Ascanius"}],"changes":[{"field":"answerEn","new":"Aeneas"},{"field":"answerDe","new":"Aeneas"},{"field":"answerRu","new":"Эней"},{"field":"spans","new":{"en":[3489,6],"de":[3836,6],"ru":[3307,4]}},{"field":"timeline","new":{"kind":"creation","start":"1618","end":"1619","precision":"year","approx":true,"ongoing":false,"labelEn":"Bernini carves „Aeneas, Anchises and Ascanius“ fleeing burning Troy","labelDe":"Bernini meißelt „Aeneas, Anchises und Ascanius“ auf der Flucht aus Troja","labelRu":"Бернини создаёт скульптуру «Эней, Анхиз и Асканий», бегущих из Трои"}},{"field":"source","new":{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aeneas","title":"Aeneas – Wikipedia","lang":"en"}}],"hash":"6132c794d608"},
{"seq":32,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"created","target":{"type":"wording","id":"w27500"},"reason":"Open question for the new fact: New question on the one Trojan prince who escaped the fall of Troy, the most important Trojan figure the article did not yet ask about; verified on Wikipedia's Aeneas article (carrying Anchises from the flames, ancestor of the Romans in the Aeneid) and its article on Bernini's sculpture (c. 1618–19).","by":"fact-count-rework","changes":[{"field":"en","new":"Which Trojan hero carried his father Anchises on his shoulders out of burning Troy and, according to Virgil, became the ancestor of the Romans?"},{"field":"de","new":"Welcher trojanische Held trug seinen Vater Anchises auf den Schultern aus dem brennenden Troja und wurde nach Vergil zum Stammvater der Römer?"},{"field":"ru","new":"Какой троянский герой вынес на плечах из горящей Трои своего отца Анхиза и, по Вергилию, стал прародителем римлян?"},{"field":"origin","new":"generated"},{"field":"fact","new":"f28500"}],"hash":"23ce4be7bd3d"},
